{{Term/Store|Radiant Tights|Radiant Tights|Series, BotW, AoC}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Radiant Tights are a piece of [[Armor]] which can be purchased at the [[Gerudo Secret Club]] in [[Gerudo Town]] after "[[The Secret Club's Secret]]" [[Side Quest]] has been completed. Fashioned using Hateno Dye made from [[Luminous Stone]]s, the Radiant Tights' skeletal markings glow when worn at night.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> The Radiant Tights can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] and can be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Radiant Tights, alongside the [[Radiant Mask]] and [[Radiant Shirt]], compose the [[Radiant Set]].

When each piece of the Radiant Set has been enhanced at least two times by a Great Fairy and the full Set is worn, it provides a "Disguise" and "Bone Atk. Up" [[Set Bonus]]. Similar to disguise masks sold by [[Kilton]] at the [[Fang and Bone]], the Radiant Set allows [[Link]] to blend in with [[Stalkoblin]]s, [[Stalmoblin]]s, and [[Stalizalfos]]. In addition, the Radiant Set causes attacks using [[Weapon|Bone Weapons]] (such as the [[Dragonbone Boko Club]]) to deal an increased amount of damage.

