==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions AoC}}
In {{AoC}}, the Radiant Tights are a piece of [[Attire]] that can only be worn by [[Link]], and are obtained the first time the [[Warrior]]s complete the [[Challenge]] "[[Deep Woods, Deep Shadow]]". They can also be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], and glow in the dark with a skeletal pattern due to a dye made of [[Luminous Stone]]s.<ref name="AoC Allies"/>

